kIndex = 0 then clear the break that caused this eventleft click on WalkStack => nFrames _ 1;right click on WalkStack => nFrames _ -1;middle click on WalkStack => nFrames _ 0;Use &H if h = NILWalk the specified number of frames up or down in the stack and change the current naming context to identify it.  nFrames positive => walk up to the nFrames'th caller (towards the root).  nFrames negative => walk deeper to the nFrames'th callee (towards the deepest frame).  nFrames = 0 => walk directly to the deepest frame.Use &H if h = NILUse &H if h = NILUse &H if h = NILUse &H if h = NIL␀ù "␀␀ñi(firstHeadersAfterPage) {1} .cvx .def (firstPageNumber) {1} .cvx .def (oneSidedFormat) {.false} .cvx .defñ"Cedar" styleò␀JöúôJöúœt%ô5Jô&Jô5IblockïMarkcenterVersoHeaderöœsúû
